{"title": "Scarlet Regeneration", "pageid": 26434, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scarlet_Regeneration", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scarlet_Regeneration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Scarlet_Regeneration.webp/300px-Scarlet_Regeneration.webp, /w/images/8/8c/Scarlet_Regeneration.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Scarlet_Regeneration.webp/300px-Scarlet_Regeneration.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Scarlet_Regeneration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Scarlet Regeneration</b> is a special class action available to the wielder of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rhapsody\" title=\"Rhapsody\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rhapsody\" title=\"Rhapsody\">Rhapsody</a>. After killing three creatures, the wielder can expend all three accumulated <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Remittance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\">Scarlet Remittance</a> charges to heal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. This action is one of the three variants of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Feast\" title=\"Scarlet Feast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp/20px-Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp/30px-Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp/40px-Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Feast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp/20px-Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Scarlet_Feast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Feast\" title=\"Scarlet Feast\">Scarlet Feast</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nIf you have a +3 bonus from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Remittance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\">Scarlet Remittance</a>, consume it to recover <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Healing: 3~30</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/D10_Healing.png/30px-D10_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/D10_Healing.png/45px-D10_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/D10_Healing.png/60px-D10_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/D10_Healing.png/30px-D10_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/D10_Healing.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d10</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Healing</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_Zhentarim_Bloodfeeding</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_Zhentarim_Bloodfeeding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_Zhentarim_Bloodfeeding\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element